message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated paper."
title: "A Multivariate POD-LSTM Reduced-Order Model for Ocean Surface Dynamics in the North Sea and Baltic Sea"
abstract: >-
  A multivariate Proper Orthogonal Decomposition - Long Short-Term Memory
  (POD-LSTM) framework that jointly embeds five coupled surface fields
  (SST, MSLP, heat flux, wind, net precipitation) from ERA5 reanalysis
  into a single low-dimensional subspace and predicts their one-month-ahead
  evolution over the North Sea and Baltic Sea.
